      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- House of Thule, Upper Floors [zone=753]\n**Who:**\n- Karivei Skyflare [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a hateful fire elemental [npc=36279]\n- an ember golem [npc=36278]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 9 22:06:53 2010\nModified: Mon Apr 4 03:58:24 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Karivei Skyflare in the House of Thule's Upper Floors (located at the western zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Karivei Skyflare'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'Vasha. Are you also here to [examine the elements] who have taken residence in the House? '\nYou say, 'Examine the elements?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'I was promised a group of adventurers, but clearly they've yet to arrive. I can only hope you'll all be suitable replacements.' She smugly grins back at \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. 'I hope you know what all this [entails].'\nYou say, 'Entails...?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'There are two particular sets of element-based life forms about the second floor. While I know many of them are not elementals, their life still seems to be drawn by the elements they enhabit: [fire] and [ice].'\nYou say, 'Fire?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'Fire, neither consuming nor ceasing, magically in a constant state of blazing heat. Several fire-like beings surround the fire, mingling with each other in the flaming rooms of the house. Will you go [seek them out] and return to me with what you find?'\nYou say, 'I'll seek them out'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'I appreciate your assistance. Return to me soon.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Drawn to Flame'.\nKarivei Skyflare has been awaiting a group of hired adventurers for assistance in his research, but they have yet to arrive. She has taken you on as a replacement, requesting that you kill and research the elements of fire as they are manifest in the house.\n\n---\n\nKill ember golems for research 0/5 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nKill hateful fire elementals for research 0/5 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_The above mobs are found in large numbers in the zone's southeastern wing. There are also a few hateful fire elementals in the northwestern wing._\nReport your findings back to Karivei 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Karivei Skyflare'\nKarivei Skyflare hears your report on the fire creatures of the second floor and jotting down the details you've supplied, he nods his head in thanks.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience _(around 1 AA worth at Level 90)_\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
