 I was experiencing seemed to become more and more lifelike.'\nYou say, 'Nightmares?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'The nightmares always involve four horrible beasts. Night after night the nightmares grew in intensity until one night I woke up here, in this accursed place. Now I cannot [leave].'\nYou say, 'Why can't you leave?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'There seems to be some force blocking my escape from this place. I have discovered that the beasts hold some sort of influence over my mind and have brought me here. They are minions of Terris Thule. Terris is up to something, hence this house. I feel her calling to me. What she wishes to gain from this, I do not know. The beasts appear to be her tools for whatever evil plan she is envisioning however. We must stop this. The beasts must be [destroyed].'\nYou say, 'Destroyed?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'Before we can confront the beasts, several potions made from the essences of the creatures that exist here are needed. We will need a [potion of rot], a [potion of the unknown], a [potion of rage], and a [potion of horror].'\nYou say, 'What about the potion of horror?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'Collect the ingredients I need for the Potion of Horror and then bring them back to me. There is no time to waste.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Beast of Horror'.\nResearcher Breoro wants you to collect Bone Dust from the bone golems, Shrunken Heads from the bone crafters, Troublesome Snake Skins from snakes, and Essences of Horror from beastlings of horror. These creatures all inhabit the first floor of the House of Thule. Once you have them, deliver them to Researchrer Breoro.\n\n---\n\nCollect 2 Bone Dusts 0/2 (House of Thule)\nCollect 2 Shrunken Heads 0/2 (House of Thule)\nCollect 2 Troublesome Snake Skins 0/2 (House of Thule)\nCollect 1 Essence of Horror 0/1 (House of Thule)\n_Items are pre-lootable._\nDeliver 2 Bone Dusts to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\nDeliver 2 Shrunken Heads to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\nDeliver 2 Troublesome Snake Skins to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\nDeliver 1 Essence of Horror to Researcher Breoro 0/1 (House of Thule)\nResearcher Breoro says 'You are doing well, my friend. The potion of horror must be mixed without error. Even the smallest mistake will ensure that I am lost to madness forever. Let's see. . . a pinch of bone dust is needed. Next the scales from the snake skins should be sloughed off into the mixture. Now, I must pour the mixture into the shrunken heads and add the essence of horror. Finally, the potion must ferment inside the shrunken heads for at least two hours. Make sure to speak with me again once all four of the potions have been brewed.'\n_Rewards:_\n158 Platinum\nExperience (about 1.5 AAs worth or more if you have a low AA count)\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers has been adjusted by 10.\n5 Dream Motes\n_Heroic characters may receive an aug choice reward. Regular characters do not._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n- Heroic Jewel of the Self [item=117793]\n- Heroic Jewel of the Self [item=116773]",
