      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- House of Thule, Lower Floors [zone=748]\n**Who:**\n- Groot [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Gumbor [npc=35777]\n- Huorun [npc=35776]\n- Korlof [npc=35806]\n- Krantz [npc=36319]\n- Torlan [npc=35778]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 25 20:18:03 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task begins with Groot, an ogre at the zone-in area of the House of Thule (lower floors)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Groot'\nGroot says 'You not look like search party, but mebbe you can [help] anyway.'\nYou say, 'I can help!'\nGroot says 'Me and my brudders find dis strange house. Dey went inside, but I [not go].'\nYou say, 'You... not go?'\nGroot says 'No, me not scared. Just don't have me favorite club to smash dem critters in dere. Anyway, you think you could go in house and [find] my brudders?'\nYou say, 'I'll find them'\nGroot says 'Thank you for help. My brudders not be so smart like me, so I little bit worried about dem.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Find My Brudders'.\nGroot wants you to find his brothers who have gone missing in the House of Thule.\n\n---\n\n_In-game /locations:_\nKrantz: 305, -40, 13 (in the room with the staircases leading to the Upper Floors)\nHuorun: 500, 245, 13 (in the hallway leading to the Library)\nGumbor: 645, 200, 13 (in the area leading to the Grounds)\nTorlan: 685, -740, -60 (in a corner in the basement's largest room)\nKorlof: 515, -385, 13 (end of the hall with the Erudin Burning entrance)\n_Map locations for thulehouse.txt:_\nP 40.0000, -305.0000, 13.0000, 0, 0, 0, 3, Krantz\nP -245.0000, -500.0000, 13.0000, 0, 0, 0, 3, Huorun\nP 200.0000, -645.0000, 13.0000, 0, 0, 0, 3, Gumbor\nP 740.0000, -685.0000, -60.0000, 0, 0, 0, 3, Torlan\nP 385.0000, -515.0000, 13.0000, 0, 0, 0, 3, Korlof\nFind Krantz on the first floor of the House of Thule 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Krantz'\nKrantz says 'Groot send you to look for me? Okay, den I not bash you in da head. Next time you see him, tell him dat I am okay.'\nFind Huorun on the first floor of the House of Thule 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Huorun'\nHuorun says 'Groot send you in here? He is big chicken. I can take care myself. You go now.'\nFind Gumbor on the first floor of the House of Thule 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gumbor'\nGumbor says 'Dis place be so wonderful. Look how pretty it be. Tell Groot to go home. He is weak and not belong in such good place.'\nFind Torlan on the first floor of the House of Thule 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Torlan'\nTorlan says 'Dis house is like good dream. Me not be leaving. Go back to Groot and tell him to take coward self home. If you see Korlof, you be careful. He become undead skelly. Mebbe you can bash him for us.'\nKorlof has become an undead abomination! Defeat him! 0/1 (House of Thule)\n_Korlof can be pulled single from the room he's in (the haunts won't assist him). He hits for a max ~6,000 (averages much lower) and has no special abilities._\nKorlof has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nKorlof's corpse crumbles into a huge pile of bones.\nReturn to Groot 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Groot'\nGroot says 'Korlof become undead? Poor Korlof. He not smart like me and stay out of house. Me thank you for finding brudders. Guess dey like house and wanna stay. Me stay here too for while I guess. Bye.'\n_Rewards:_\n158 platinum\nExperience (1.5 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n5 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
