      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- House of Thule, Upper Floors [zone=753]\n**Who:**\n- Abbit Scribbletch [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Agent of Morzad [npc=36309]\n- Keega [npc=36297]\n- Morzad Agent [npc=36577]\n- Swindler Keega [npc=36579]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Morzad Chronicle - Argan's Memoir (#1) [quest=5197]\n- Morzad Chronicle - Dead or Alive or Other (#4) [quest=5200]\n- Morzad Chronicle - Never Trust a Morzad (#3) [quest=5199]\n- Morzad Chronicle - The Morzad Confrontation (#5) [quest=5201]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 8 23:31:06 2010\nModified: Tue Mar 22 23:02:53 2011 | | _This task is the second in a series of five that begins with Abbit Scribbletch, a gnome found in the first room on the left immediately on entering the northeastern wing of the House of Thule's Upper Floors._\n_You must have completed his first task prior to being able to request this one._\nYou say, 'Hail, Abbit Scribbletch'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'Unbelievable! The book is a [fake]!'\nYou say, 'Fake?'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'Yes! You must find Keega and find out what in Norrath is going on!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Morzad Chronicle - Abbit's Betrayal'.\nAbbit Scribbletch is angry over Keega's betrayal. You must help him find out where the real memoir is located.\n\n---\n\nSpeak to Keega 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Keega'\nKeega says 'You are in over your head!'\n_Keega respawns as Swindler Keega and attacks. He hits for a max ~7,200._\nDefeat the Swindler Keega! 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nSwindler Keega has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nSpeak to Keega 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Keega'\nKeega says 'Enough... It is not my fault. An agent of the Morzad contacted me while back. I was to lure that Abbit fellow here, and then make sure he got the fake copy of the book! I am sure he is still here in the northeastern wing.'\nSpeak to Agent of Morzad 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_A Dwarf called \"Agent of Morzad\" spawns in the far northeast part of the zone. He's in a room alongside the Morzad Watercaster (for a later task) and some undead._\n_NOTE: An ambush spawns right after you hail him. You can do this hail while invis as the ambushers do not see invisibility._\nYou say, 'Hail, Agent of Morzad'\nAgent of Morzad says 'That fool, Keega! I knew he could not be trusted! I am not sure what you hope to gain. I have nothing to say to you.'\n_Three Morzad Agents spawn around the room and attack. They don't see invisibility. They each hit for a max ~6,500 and are susceptible to most forms of crowd control: mezzable, rootable/snareable, and stunnable._\nDefend yourself from the Morzad ambush 0/3 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_Note: The spawned Agents only stay up for a certain period of time (it's several minutes). If you wipe out and they despawn, you have to start the task from the beginning._\nSpeak to Abbit Scribbletch 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Abbit Scribbletch'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'I cannot believe they thought they could fool me with that counterfeit book! Thank you for all you have done for me so far. When you return, if you should return, I may have another contact from who we may get some answers.'\nYou have discovered that Keega was working for the Morzad. The books location is still in question.\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers got better.\n_Rewards:_\n220 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
