      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- House of Thule, Upper Floors [zone=753]\n**Who:**\n- Karivei Skyflare [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a nightmarish beast [npc=36290]\n- a soul devourer [npc=36289]\n- an iceworn guardian [npc=36296]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 9 22:06:58 2010\nModified: Tue Nov 9 22:12:28 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Karivei Skyflare in the House of Thule's Upper Floors (located at the western zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Karivei Skyflare'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'Vasha. Are you also here to [examine the elements] who have taken residence in the House? '\nYou say, 'Examine the elements?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'I was promised a group of adventurers, but clearly they've yet to arrive. I can only hope you'll all be suitable replacements.' She smugly grins back at \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. 'I hope you know what all this [entails].'\nYou say, 'Entails...?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'There are two particular sets of element-based life forms about the second floor. While I know many of them are not elementals, their life still seems to be drawn by the elements they enhabit: [fire] and [ice].'\nYou say, 'Ice?'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'These certainly don't appear to be of the elements, directly, but their existance alone and how they seem to have sprung up with the magical ice that inhabits those halls is something to [investigate], if you're willing.'\nYou say, 'I'll investigate'\nKarivei Skyflare says 'Karui, slaughter a few and get back to me on your understanding of them. And quickly, because I'm not the most patient.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Of Ice and Men'.\nKarivei Skyflare has been awaiting a group of hired adventurers for assistance in his research, but they have yet to arrive. She has taken you on as a replacement, requesting that you kill and research the elements of ice and frost as they are manifest in the house.\n\n---\n\nKill nightmarish beasts for research 0/6 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nKill soul devourers for research 0/2 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nKill iceworn guardians for research 0/2 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_The above mobs are all confined to the southwestern wing of the zone._\nReport your findings back to Karivei 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Karivei Skyflare'\nKarivei Skyflare hears your report on the ice creatures of the second floor and jotting down the details you've supplied, she nods his head in thanks.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience _(around 1 AA worth at Level 90)_\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
