      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- House of Thule, Upper Floors [zone=753]\n**Who:**\n- Andre MacDonnal [npc=36303]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a cheerless apparition [npc=36293]\n- a ghostly vision [npc=36273]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 9 22:07:02 2010\nModified: Tue Nov 9 22:12:36 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Andre MacDonnal in the House of Thule's Upper Floors (located at the eastern zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Andre MacDonnal'\nAndre MacDonnal sleepily looks up. 'Hail and well met, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I've been trying to get back to the waking world through sleep, but it doesn't seem to help. At least I believe I hit the [first step] by being aware that I'm dreaming, wouldn't you say?'\nYou say, 'What first step?'\nAndre MacDonnal nods. 'You know, I'd get out of here before you're stuck, too. I'm pretty sure the denizens about would be detrimental to you in the waking world should they find you here. Death here may very well be permanant. I almost wonder if some of the [denizens] here may be the result of that exact thing.'\nYou say, 'What denizens?'\nAndre MacDonnal says 'Well, many of the undead share similarities with the spirit world, so I'm unsure if they were trapped here through death, or if they are too stuck in a dream state. In that respect, would you mind doing [something] for me?'\nYou say, 'What something would that be?'\nAndre MacDonnal says 'Would you [engage] some of the undead in battle and report to me on their behavior? I am curious as to what their true manifestation is, and any behavioral analysis you can give will help this old shaman.'\nYou say, 'I'll engage them...'\nAndre MacDonnal nods approvingly, a smile flashing. 'Many thanks, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Report back to me soon, and good luck.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Spirit Bound'.\nThe shaman Andre MacDonnal is aware he's in a dream state that he's attempting to shake. However, in the meantime, he's not quite sure the state of the spiritual manifestations on the second floor. Curious, he's asked for information on how they behave in battle and death, seeking your assistance.\n\n---\n\nEngage and kill several ghostly visions 0/4 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nEngage and kill cheerless apparitions 0/5 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\n_These mobs are found in many areas throughout the zone._\nHail Andre MacDonnal 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Andre MacDonnal'\nAndre MacDonnal looks up in worry. 'You mean to say that they appear to have become trapped through their dreams and nightmares and that is why they wander as spirits so? This is troubling and makes our predicament even more precarious. ...Thank you for looking into it.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience _(around 1 AA worth at Level 90)_\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
